# A middle counter piece with three drawers. No side outline, so a run reads
# as one slab. Things set on it use origin <height + 2> to sit on the slab,
# back from its edge.
sprite kitchen-counter
size 16 32
layer object
footprint 1 1
origin 0 16
tag counter kitchen
variant teal A=T a=t 4=6

frame default
